//// The `onze-release` package — module-tree root.
////
//// Deploy time — the build id, the OTP release, the Dockerfile,
//// the boot script and the static export.
////
//// A skeleton created by front 95 (`specs/1.0.10-beta/06-onze/modules.md`
//// § The cut): an empty `pub` surface and one inline test, so the member is a
//// row of `zig build test-libs` from the first commit. Owner: front 71.

test "onze-release: the member compiles and runs on its rows" {
    assert "onze-release".length() == 12;
}
